# Production Environment
# OMC runs single-origin: the backend serves the built UI + /api + WebSocket
# all on ONE port (4825). The app derives the WS URL from window.location,
# so nothing needs to be hardcoded here — open it on any host/port and the
# WebSocket follows the same origin automatically.
#
# Only set VITE_WS_URL below if you ever serve the UI behind a DIFFERENT
# origin than the WebSocket (e.g. a real reverse-proxied domain):
# VITE_WS_URL=wss://your-domain.com
